### Dashboard Home (Role-Adaptive)

```typescript
// page.tsx - Dashboard home
export default function DashboardPage() {
  const { user, hasPermission } = useAuth();

  return (
    <div className="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4">
      {/* ROOT user sees platform-wide stats */}
      {user.isRoot && (
        <>
          <StatCard title="Total Tenants" value={stats.totalTenants} />
          <StatCard title="Active Subscriptions" value={stats.activeSubscriptions} />
          <StatCard title="Platform Revenue" value={stats.platformRevenue} />
          <StatCard title="Total Students" value={stats.totalStudents} />
        </>
      )}

      {/* Admin/Employee sees establishment overview */}
      {hasPermission('dashboard:view') && (
        <>
          <StatCard title="Total Students" value={stats.students} />
          <StatCard title="Total Teachers" value={stats.teachers} />
          <StatCard title="Active Classes" value={stats.classes} />
          <StatCard title="Revenue This Month" value={stats.revenue} />
          <AttendanceChart />
          <PaymentChart />
          <ClassPerformanceChart />
        </>
      )}

      {/* Teacher sees their classes */}
      {hasPermission('teacher:dashboard:view') && (
        <>
          <StatCard title="My Classes" value={stats.myClasses} />
          <StatCard title="Students" value={stats.myStudents} />
          <StatCard title="Today's Sessions" value={stats.todaySessions} />
          <PendingGrades />
          <UpcomingExams />
        </>
      )}

      {/* Student sees their info */}
      {user.role === 'STUDENT' && (
        <>
          <StatCard title="My Average" value={stats.myAverage} />
          <StatCard title="Attendance" value={stats.myAttendance} />
          <UpcomingExams />
          <RecentGrades />
        </>
      )}

      {/* Parent sees children */}
      {user.role === 'PARENT' && (
        <>
          <ChildrenOverview />
          <PendingPayments />
          <RecentNotifications />
        </>
      )}
    </div>
  );
}
```

---

## Summary of Changes

| Area | Change |
|------|--------|
| **Auth Flow** | Middleware checks subscription, Guard checks permissions, ROOT bypasses all |
| **JWT Payload** | `{ userId, email, establishmentId?, tenantId?, isRoot }` |
| **Frontend** | Single dynamic dashboard, adapts menu/content by role + permissions |
| **Establishment Switcher** | Dropdown in header for Root users (can switch tenant context) |
| **Permission Check** | Both backend (guard) and frontend (PermissionGate component) |
| **Data Isolation** | Auto-filter by tenantId + establishmentId in all queries |

