Fix ALL responsive, UX, loading, and toast notification issues across the BSofts School frontend at E:\ReFactory\BSofts-School\frontend.

## RULES:
- Read each file first before editing
- Use `useTranslation()` with `t()` for ALL visible text
- Keep existing code style
- All `grid grid-cols-2` in forms → `grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2`
- All page headers → `flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4`
- All action button touch targets → minimum `p-2` (was `p-1`)
- All summary stat grids → `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3` or `grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4`
- After successful CRUD: call `toast.showToast({ message: t('...'), type: 'success' })` 
- After failed CRUD: call `toast.showToast({ message: t('...'), type: 'error' })`
- Show error message on fetch failure instead of just console.error
- Show loading spinner during fetches
- Show empty state message when data is empty

## FILES TO FIX:

### 1. `src/components/layout/sidebar.tsx`
- Add `pb-4` to the scroll container nav
- Change close button from `p-1` to `p-2`

### 2. `src/components/layout/header.tsx`
- Add mobile search: change `hidden md:flex` to a collapsible search on mobile
- Add `truncate` to page title h1
- Add `max-w-[calc(100vw-2rem)]` to notification dropdown
- Add `title` attribute to truncated text

### 3. `src/components/ui/pagination.tsx`
- Add responsive layout: `flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-2`
- Hide page info on very small screens: `hidden sm:block`

### 4. `src/components/ui/modal.tsx`
- Add mobile width: add `w-[calc(100vw-2rem)]` alongside existing max-w classes

### 5. `src/components/ui/toast.tsx`
- Change toast position: `bottom-4 left-4 right-4 sm:left-auto sm:right-4`
- Add `max-w-sm` to toast container
- Change auto-dismiss from 3000 to 5000

### 6. ALL form components (student-form, teacher-form, class-form, exam-form, employee-form, parent-form, payment-form, room-form, holiday-form):
- Change ALL `grid grid-cols-2` to `grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2`

### 7. ALL dashboard page files - add loading spinners, error states, empty states, and toast notifications:
- `src/app/(dashboard)/students/page.tsx` - loading spinner, error state, toast after delete
- `src/app/(dashboard)/teachers/page.tsx` - same
- `src/app/(dashboard)/parents/page.tsx` - same, plus toast after create/update
- `src/app/(dashboard)/employees/page.tsx` - same
- `src/app/(dashboard)/classes/page.tsx` - same
- `src/app/(dashboard)/payments/page.tsx` - same, plus responsive stat grid
- `src/app/(dashboard)/exams/page.tsx` - same
- `src/app/(dashboard)/attendance/page.tsx` - responsive header, responsive stat grid, empty state
- `src/app/(dashboard)/schedule/page.tsx` - responsive header, error states
- `src/app/(dashboard)/reports/page.tsx` - responsive header, responsive stat grid, loading state
- `src/app/(dashboard)/settings/page.tsx` - responsive settings layout (sidebar → tabs on mobile)

For EACH page, the pattern should be:
```tsx
// Add import for Spinner if not already imported
import { Spinner } from '@/components/ui/spinner';

// In the component, add loading state
const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);
const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);

// In fetch functions, wrap with setLoading/setError
useEffect(() => {
  const fetchData = async () => {
    try {
      setLoading(true);
      const res = await api.get('/endpoint');
      // ...
    } catch (err) {
      setError(t('common.error'));
      console.error(err);
    } finally {
      setLoading(false);
    }
  };
  fetchData();
}, []);

// In render, show loading/error states
if (loading) return <div className="flex items-center justify-center p-8"><Spinner /></div>;
if (error) return <div className="p-8 text-center text-red-500">{error}</div>;

// For empty states in tables:
{data.length === 0 && (
  <div className="p-8 text-center text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
    {t('common.noData')}
  </div>
)}

// For toast after operations:
import { useToast } from '@/components/ui/toast';
const toast = useToast();

// After successful create/update/delete:
toast.showToast({ message: t('crud.createSuccess'), type: 'success' });
```

