// attendance/reports: grid grid-cols-4 → grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4
```

IMPORTANT: Import `useToast` from `@/components/ui/toast` in each page that needs it.
IMPORTANT: Import `Spinner` from `@/components/ui/spinner` in each page.
IMPORTANT: Make MINIMAL changes - only add what's needed, don't rewrite entire files.

Return a summary of ALL changes made.

